Suggests: tvwcs-boot-logo
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: TV launcher, workspace switcher and settings for sway, made for a remote
 TVWCS is a Metro-style Quick Menu and applications guide for sway, with a Settings app for sound, displays, power,
 Bluetooth, the network, updates and more, all usable with a TV remote. Its "TVWCS" session at the login screen runs
 it in TV mode; included in a usual sway session it runs in desktop mode.
